{% comment %}
  al_math 1.0.2 emits MathJax on every page when site.enable_math is true
  and does not read page.math. Gate the tag so the ~1.1MB script loads only
  where a page opts in with math: true (or pseudocode / tikzjax).
  Leave enable_math true: the plugin emits nothing when that flag is false.
{% endcomment %}
{% if page.math or page.pseudocode or page.tikzjax %}
  {% al_math_scripts %}
{% endif %}
